#: ../../interface.rst:2
msgid "The interface"
msgstr "界面"

#: ../../interface.rst:4
msgid ""
"The window is three regions: a toolbar on top, a column of track labels on "
"the left, and one canvas per track filling the rest."
msgstr "窗口分为三个区域：顶部是工具栏，左侧是一列轨道标签，其余空间由每条轨道各自的一块画布填满。"

#: ../../interface.rst:8
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "工具栏"

#: ../../interface.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Assembly selector** — switch genome; annotation reloads, sequence follows"
msgstr "**装配选择器** — 切换基因组；注释随之重新加载，序列也自动跟随"

#: ../../interface.rst:11
msgid "**Search box** — locus, gene symbol, or a motif pattern"
msgstr "**搜索框** — 支持位点、基因符号或基序模式"

#: ../../interface.rst:12
msgid "**Zoom controls** — plus, minus, and a fit-to-window button"
msgstr "**缩放控件** — 放大、缩小，以及一个适应窗口按钮"

#: ../../interface.rst:13
msgid "**Export** — PNG, SVG or PDF for the current view"
msgstr "**导出** — 把当前视图存成 PNG、SVG 或 PDF"

#: ../../interface.rst:14
msgid "**Split view** — show two, three or four independent loci side by side"
msgstr "**分屏视图** — 并排显示两、三或四个相互独立的位点"

#: ../../interface.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Language** — the ``中`` / ``EN`` button at the far right switches the whole"
" interface between Chinese and English. The choice is remembered across "
"launches, and the view you are looking at is restored."
msgstr ""
"**界面语言** — 最右侧的 ``中`` / ``EN`` "
"按钮可在中英文之间整体切换界面。选择会被记住，下次启动依然生效，当前浏览的视野也会一并恢复。"

#: ../../interface.rst:20
msgid "Track labels"
msgstr "轨道标签"

#: ../../interface.rst:22
msgid "Every track has a label cell on the left. The label carries:"
msgstr "每条轨道左侧都有一个标签格。标签中包含："

#: ../../interface.rst:24
msgid "a checkbox to show or hide the track,"
msgstr "显示或隐藏该轨道的复选框，"

#: ../../interface.rst:25
msgid "the track name (click to open settings),"
msgstr "轨道名称（点击可打开设置），"

#: ../../interface.rst:26
msgid "a one-line summary — gene count, signal range, or data source,"
msgstr "一行摘要 — 基因数量、信号范围或数据来源，"

#: ../../interface.rst:27
msgid "for imported tracks, a menu with *remove*, *rename* and *reload*."
msgstr "对于导入的轨道，还有一个菜单，包含 *移除*、*重命名* 和 *重新加载*。"

#: ../../interface.rst:30
msgid "Track types"
msgstr "轨道类型"

#: ../../interface.rst:36
msgid "Track"
msgstr "轨道"

#: ../../interface.rst:37
msgid "What it draws"
msgstr "绘制内容"

#: ../../interface.rst:38
msgid "Ideogram"
msgstr "染色体示意图"

#: ../../interface.rst:39
msgid ""
"Cytobands for the whole chromosome, with a marker for the visible window"
msgstr "整条染色体的细胞遗传带，并用标记框出当前可见范围"

#: ../../interface.rst:40
msgid "Ruler"
msgstr "标尺"

#: ../../interface.rst:41
msgid "Tick marks and coordinates; the scale switches units as you zoom"
msgstr "刻度线与坐标；缩放时刻度会自动切换单位"

#: ../../interface.rst:42
msgid "RefSeq genes"
msgstr "RefSeq 基因"

#: ../../interface.rst:43
msgid "Gene models; click a gene to expand its transcripts"
msgstr "基因模型；点击某个基因可展开其转录本"

#: ../../interface.rst:44
msgid "Signal"
msgstr "信号"

#: ../../interface.rst:45
msgid "bigWig or bedGraph values as a filled area, autoscaled or fixed"
msgstr "以填充面积形式绘制 bigWig 或 bedGraph 数值，可自动缩放或固定范围"

#: ../../interface.rst:46
msgid "GC content"
msgstr "GC 含量"

#: ../../interface.rst:47
msgid "GC percentage in windows across the visible range"
msgstr "按窗口统计可见范围内的 GC 百分比"

#: ../../interface.rst:48
msgid "Sequence"
msgstr "序列"

#: ../../interface.rst:49
msgid "Coloured bases, shown once each base has enough pixels"
msgstr "彩色碱基；只有当每个碱基分到足够像素时才会显示"

#: ../../interface.rst:52
msgid "Gene track settings"
msgstr "基因轨道设置"

#: ../../interface.rst:54
msgid "Click the gene track label to open its panel."
msgstr "点击基因轨道标签即可打开其设置面板。"

#: ../../interface.rst:60 ../../interface.rst:78
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../interface.rst:61 ../../interface.rst:79
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../interface.rst:62
msgid "Display mode"
msgstr "显示模式"

#: ../../interface.rst:63
msgid "*Expanded* draws every transcript; *Collapsed* draws one row per gene"
msgstr "*展开* 绘制每个转录本；*折叠* 每个基因只占一行"

#: ../../interface.rst:64
msgid "Colour by"
msgstr "着色依据"

#: ../../interface.rst:65
msgid "Strand, or a single colour"
msgstr "按链着色，或统一使用单一颜色"

#: ../../interface.rst:66
msgid "Labels"
msgstr "标签"

#: ../../interface.rst:67
msgid "Show gene symbols, transcript accessions, or nothing"
msgstr "显示基因符号、转录本编号，或什么都不显示"

#: ../../interface.rst:68
msgid "Height"
msgstr "高度"

#: ../../interface.rst:69
msgid "Row height in pixels, which also controls how many genes fit"
msgstr "行高（像素），同时也决定了能容纳多少基因"

#: ../../interface.rst:72
msgid "Signal track settings"
msgstr "信号轨道设置"

#: ../../interface.rst:80
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "刻度"

#: ../../interface.rst:81
msgid "*Autoscale* fits the visible window; *Fixed* pins the range"
msgstr "*自动* 随可见窗口调整；*固定* 则锁定范围"

#: ../../interface.rst:82
msgid "Range"
msgstr "范围"

#: ../../interface.rst:83
msgid "Min and max when the scale is fixed"
msgstr "刻度固定时的最小值与最大值"

#: ../../interface.rst:84
msgid "Colour"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ../../interface.rst:85
msgid "Per-track colour; groups can share one tint"
msgstr "按轨道单独设色；同一分组可共用一种色调"

#: ../../interface.rst:86
msgid "Draw mode"
msgstr "绘制方式"

#: ../../interface.rst:87
msgid "Filled area, bar, or line"
msgstr "填充面积、柱状或折线"

#: ../../interface.rst:88
msgid "Overlay"
msgstr "叠加"

#: ../../interface.rst:89
msgid "Stack tracks, or overlay several samples in one row"
msgstr "轨道上下堆叠，或把多个样本叠加在同一行"

#: ../../interface.rst:92
msgid "Display options"
msgstr "显示选项"

#: ../../interface.rst:94
msgid ""
"The appearance menu toggles the dark theme, the label density, and whether "
"the whole-genome overview starts expanded. Preferences are stored per user "
"and restored on the next launch."
msgstr "外观菜单可切换深色主题、标签密度，以及全基因组总览是否默认展开。偏好按用户保存，下次启动时自动恢复。"
